//// set: fv-f3 — 函数变量属性：表达式维的 fill、二维未知维、多层短类 + 声明修饰、属性名不对（omc 报错）、数组值属性
//// model: F30
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input Integer n;
input V v[n];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := sum(v);
end f;
model F30
Real x = f(2, {time, 1});
end F30;
//// model: F31
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input V v[:, :];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := sum(v);
end f;
model F31
Real x = f({{time, 1}});
end F31;
//// model: F32
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input Real x[:];
output V y[size(x, 1)];
algorithm
y := x;
end f;
model F32
Real z[2] = f({time, 1});
end F32;
//// model: F33
type V = Real;
function f
input V v;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F33
Real x = f(time);
end F33;
//// model: F34
type N = Integer(min = 1, max = 10);
function f
input N n;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * n;
end f;
model F34
parameter Integer k = 3;
Real x = f(k) * time;
end F34;
//// model: F35
type V = Real(unit = "V", start = 1);
function f
input V v;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F35
Real x = f(time);
end F35;
//// model: F36
type V = Real(unit = "V");
function f
input Real a;
output V y = 2 * a;
end f;
model F36
Real x = f(time);
end F36;
//// model: F37
type V = Real(unit = "V");
type W = V(displayUnit = "kV");
function f
input W v(min = 0);
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F37
Real x = f(time);
end F37;
//// model: F38
function f
input Real v(foo = 1);
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * v;
end f;
model F38
Real x = f(time);
end F38;
//// model: F39
function f
input Real v[2](unit = {"V", "A"});
output Real y;
algorithm
y := sum(v);
end f;
model F39
Real x = f({time, 1});
end F39;
